<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen June cotton fibre output doubles mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Turkmen June cotton fibre output doubles mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan cotton fibre production doubled in June to 1,200 tonnes from 600 tonnes in May, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>TURKMEN COTTON FIBRE OUTPUT  June '97  May '97  Jan-June '97</p>
<p>    Production (tonnes)		1,200     600	24,100</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change	+100	0.0	 n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	   n/a	n/a	-86.0</p>
<p>Around 90 percent of Turkmen cotton fibre is exported to Hong Kong, Switzerland, Sweden, Turkey and Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
